## Architecture: Before vs After

```
BEFORE (current — orphaned):
ThinkRunner → SynthesisEngine → StrategicReasoner (5 LLM, NO technique input)
                               → TechniqueOrch (15 T00-T14, results stored but UNUSED)
                               → SBEBridge (MTDE capped at 50 tokens)
                               → VerdictGenerator (NEVER CALLED)
                               → PredictionEngine (NEVER CALLED)

AFTER (wired):
ThinkRunner → SynthesisEngine → TechniqueOrch (15 T00-T14)
                                     ↓ technique_results
                               → StrategicReasoner (5 LLM, RECEIVES techniques + learning)
                                     ↓ merged verdict (includes VerdictGenerator logic)
                               → PredictionEngine (receives outcome, updates Bayesian priors)
                                     ↓ calibrated weights
                               → OutputFormatter (narrates technique insights + strategic reasoning)
                               → AdversarialOrchestrator (personas get technique context)
```

